{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"cd8ed61e07244a4811846ff59149369149205a854960dce20a46931a8159a63b","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review gate","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/plan_review/attest.py","plan-review-criteria-guide.md","BLOCK verdict","CERTIFIED signature","rising floor","LLM tier","T5c security overlay","epic/audit-enrichment"],"problem_keywords":["plan-review","cycle-reduction","blocking findings","convergence floor","eligibility","coaching attachment","criteria guidance","security overlay","defect fan-out"],"propositions":["Per-round block rate reaches 50–67% since calibration 2, with 87% of blocking findings novel each round, causing excessive plan-review iteration.","One defect generates up to 10 blocking findings per round (defect fan-out), multiplying remediation burden.","Convergence rising floor never engages in BLOCK loops because BLOCK verdicts never mint CERTIFIED signatures, rendering 240+ reviews ineligible.","Coaching notes and criteria deep-links attach only to advisory findings, never to blocking findings that agents must remediate.","Plan authors are never routed to plan-review-criteria-guide.md, causing predictable LLM-tier failures on first drafts.","T5c security overlay contributes 288 findings per 7 days of advisory noise, including out-of-scope findings, without blocking impact."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785824420867160887,"uuid":"ea28f082-c3f4-4a5d-97a6-793897080b1e"}